    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677140/extras/0366f2660e461e257c54c31b399a3e85.poster.avif?t=1755505686\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677140/extras/0366f2660e461e257c54c31b399a3e85.webm?t=1755505686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677140/extras/0366f2660e461e257c54c31b399a3e85.mp4?t=1755505686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Timelines, One Mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore both modern and medieval versions of the same city. Unravel a mystery shaped by centuries-old rivalry.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with the Past \u2014 as a Ghost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t speak. You can\u2019t be seen. But you can affect the world. Solve puzzles by influencing objects and environments across time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677140/extras/a595fc39a3dfe443b77ec8e7cc54c6f2.poster.avif?t=1755505686\" width=610 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677140/extras/a595fc39a3dfe443b77ec8e7cc54c6f2.webm?t=1755505686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677140/extras/a595fc39a3dfe443b77ec8e7cc54c6f2.mp4?t=1755505686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric, Puzzle-Focused Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat. Just thoughtful exploration, rich storytelling and puzzle solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Curse That Won\u2019t Let Go</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the origin of a time-warping curse born from desperation, and follow the path of an ancient rivalry between thieves and pirates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Comic Panel Cutscenes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a unique visual narrative told through comic book panels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Will you escape the curse\u2026 or remain just a whisper?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677140/extras/e5bd0b7a39b7c8c4b3256c2c1e51fe61.avif?t=1755505686\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677140/extras/0366f2660e461e257c54c31b399a3e85.poster.avif?t=1755505686\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677140/extras/0366f2660e461e257c54c31b399a3e85.webm?t=1755505686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677140/extras/0366f2660e461e257c54c31b399a3e85.mp4?t=1755505686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Timelines, One Mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore both modern and medieval versions of the same city. Unravel a mystery shaped by centuries-old rivalry.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with the Past \u2014 as a Ghost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t speak. You can\u2019t be seen. But you can affect the world. Solve puzzles by influencing objects and environments across time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677140/extras/a595fc39a3dfe443b77ec8e7cc54c6f2.poster.avif?t=1755505686\" width=610 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677140/extras/a595fc39a3dfe443b77ec8e7cc54c6f2.webm?t=1755505686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677140/extras/a595fc39a3dfe443b77ec8e7cc54c6f2.mp4?t=1755505686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric, Puzzle-Focused Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat. Just thoughtful exploration, rich storytelling and puzzle solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Curse That Won\u2019t Let Go</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the origin of a time-warping curse born from desperation, and follow the path of an ancient rivalry between thieves and pirates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Comic Panel Cutscenes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a unique visual narrative told through comic book panels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Will you escape the curse\u2026 or remain just a whisper?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677140/extras/e5bd0b7a39b7c8c4b3256c2c1e51fe61.avif?t=1755505686\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p>",
